TL7vNzn_TtaLqgAvCeTov6GNs07t4xoqG_nQ&oe=6A71F59A"}, {"file_name": "Undercover_Screenshots_04.png", "id": "720210893537540", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031399_720210896870873_1607751032437242072_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LHvB7QzoHUsQ7kNvwFVI5MF&_nc_oc=AdqNDfoMkMsxNAt-O9WjDeQBXWV9RKWh4iRyqVEE-rvhttdFH-DsEGIMWQSp-EhEH8w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFFECGrbWBasGKpUFLHG09pdEb8e25kFJi3-d775N7_jA&oe=6A71DEAC"}, {"file_name": "Undercover_Screenshots_05.png", "id": "743045670695496", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974602_743045674028829_4316921965278868238_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8oqeHUcCFeEQ7kNvwG43RTS&_nc_oc=AdqlZCM-utWITAdYx4yFTrm8Q45w68yttMSnPlksMU1jAO19KN5ZWk8_3gkeEdzLFWE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF8yEP3WjvgLZVaDwJqG8Zie2lJU-M0SiwHQlsxpoorXg&oe=6A720406"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Undercover_MRUpdate_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "373812651999851", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86655527_373812658666517_8384652531129662568_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c60Brht5uU4Q7kNvwHiauB3&_nc_oc=Adq8ccW4-HdaOiwOFG4Dsv8bhCeU-lx93JocUlOzyM49DnxlFA_y4_vIRq3rbKP7ue4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEpB9qAHcMgJq1wn1t5vXZRbsB5YeunJOunXZRiVoseJw&oe=6A71EB5C"}, "display_name": "Under Cover", "keywords": ["FPS", "arcade", "action", "guns", "shooter"], "long_description": "Under Cover: a Lightgun Cover Shooter inspired by arcade classics.\nDuck to reload with the groundbreaking Active Cover System. Rack up solo or co-op high scores as Red-Eye or Magnum - two undercover agents too cool to stay undercover - in the action-packed buddy-cop campaign.\n\nYour mission: infiltrate evil megacorp Infinidyne, take down CEO Pax Harrison, and shut down his mind-control technology before he turns billions into cybernetic meat puppets.\n\n\u2022 Classic lightgun arcade action, made for VR.\n\u2022 Take on Infinidyne solo with an AI partner or co-op with an online friend.\n\u2022 Reload and dodge enemy fire like an action hero with the Active Cover System.\n\u2022 Over-the-top cinematic action with explosions, bullet time, and environmental destruction.\n\u2022 Retro score system rewards aim, speed, and chained kills.\n\u2022 Use your skills, the environment, and a wide variety of special weapons to take out goons, advanced enemies, and Infinidyne bosses.\n\nAre you ready to go Under Cover?", "short_description": "Under Cover: a Lightgun Cover Shooter inspired by arcade classics.\n\nDuck to reload with the groundbreaking Active Cover System. Rack up solo or co-op high scores as Red-Eye or Magnum - two undercover agents too cool to stay undercover - in the action-packed buddy-cop campaign."}]}, "developer_name": "Sigtrap", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://coatsink.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Coatsink", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://coatsink.com/games/undercover", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "de", "es", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["CO_OP", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8705606369556700"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.ocu